# Inf-Splitter environment variables
# Set your API keys and other secrets here. They are read by inf-splitter
# and resolved as ${VAR} references in /etc/inf-splitter/inf-splitter.toml.
#
# The config path is already set in the systemd service. Override here if needed:
# INF_SPLITTER_CONFIG=/etc/inf-splitter/inf-splitter.toml
#
# Example (uncomment and fill in):
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
# MAAS_API_KEY=your-maas-key
